  "masked_method": "A separate preparer recreated the prior crop and cover rectangles, placed adjacent views side by side, and randomly ordered the same 13 renderings for each reader in fresh isolated contexts. Readers received only numbered images and the rubric, without specimen names, provenance, or predicted correspondences. Some residual text could remain outside the masked header areas, and recognizable drawings could cue identity. The comparison paired scores by the matching masked PNG hashes before revealing the manuscript mapping. Consensus requires identical definite reader marks, and otherwise retains an unknown. Full-scan audit notes were made after the frozen ratings and do not change them.",
